    {
      "id": "uSL74cgQdyMC7UfXXMNg-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1785.271753837982,
      "y": 561.2556725482709,
      "width": 1448.3735005796643,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 277486211,
      "version": 5147,
      "versionNonce": 173057827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792514030927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Push\n    a) Add values to the aggregate for the target keys \n        i) Server applies the update rule, returns at once with a Task\n        ii) idempotent per TaskID\n    b) Errors\n        i) INVALID_ARGUMENT :  length mismatch\n        ii) NOT_OWNER : stale map; client refreshes and retries\n        iii) UNAVAILABLE\n        iv) TIMEOUT\n\n2. Pull\n    a) Returns current weights for the target keys, subject to the call's consistency option, absent keys read as the initial values\n    b) Errors\n        i) INVALID_ARGUMENT :  length mismatch\n        ii) NOT_OWNER : stale map; client refreshes and retries\n        iii) UNAVAILABLE\n        iv) TIMEOUT\n        v) DEPENDENCY_FAILED : dep failed\n\n3. Wait\n    a) Blocks until completion or timeout, a timed-out task is still running, calling wait again is legal\n    b) Errors\n        i) TIMEOUT\n\n4. Deps\n    a) A task whose dependency failed fails with DEPENDENCY_FAILED and must not execut",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Push\n    a) Add values to the aggregate for the target keys \n        i) Server applies the update rule, returns at once with a Task\n        ii) idempotent per TaskID\n    b) Errors\n        i) INVALID_ARGUMENT :  length mismatch\n        ii) NOT_OWNER : stale map; client refreshes and retries\n        iii) UNAVAILABLE\n        iv) TIMEOUT\n\n2. Pull\n    a) Returns current weights for the target keys, subject to the call's consistency option, absent keys read as the initial values\n    b) Errors\n        i) INVALID_ARGUMENT :  length mismatch\n        ii) NOT_OWNER : stale map; client refreshes and retries\n        iii) UNAVAILABLE\n        iv) TIMEOUT\n        v) DEPENDENCY_FAILED : dep failed\n\n3. Wait\n    a) Blocks until completion or timeout, a timed-out task is still running, calling wait again is legal\n    b) Errors\n        i) TIMEOUT\n\n4. Deps\n    a) A task whose dependency failed fails with DEPENDENCY_FAILED and must not execut",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
